// Shared save-boundary schema, intentionally included twice.
// SAVED_GLOBAL: full native field with the corresponding saved member.
// SAVED_INTERFACE: packed disk text with spare native string capacity.
// SAVED_VIEW: explicit aliases or partial fields in the legacy format.
// The codec generates descriptors and width checks from these same rows.
// Ordering is significant for aliases and independent history tracking.

